legal-dmca-title = DMCA Safe Harbor Notice
legal-dmca-updated = Last updated: August 2026
legal-dmca-1-title = 1. Our Role — Link Aggregator, Not a Host
legal-dmca-1-body = { $brand } is a link aggregator and search engine. We do not host, upload, store, transmit, or control any video or media content. All content is served from third-party servers that are entirely outside of our control.
legal-dmca-2-title = 2. Notice-and-Takedown Procedure
legal-dmca-2-body = If you are a copyright owner, or an agent authorised to act on behalf of a copyright owner, and you believe that a link in our index infringes your copyright, please send a written notice to { $support_email } containing:
legal-dmca-2-b1 = <strong>Physical or electronic signature</strong> of the copyright owner or their authorised agent.
legal-dmca-2-b2 = <strong>Identification of the copyrighted work</strong> you claim has been infringed, or if multiple works are covered by a single notice, a representative list of such works.
legal-dmca-2-b3 = <strong>Identification of the material</strong> (i.e. the specific { $brand } link or URL) that you claim is infringing, with sufficient information to permit us to locate it.
legal-dmca-3-title = 3. Additional Required Elements
legal-dmca-3-body = Your DMCA notice must also include:
legal-dmca-3-b1 = <strong>Your contact information</strong> — name, address, telephone number, and email address.
legal-dmca-3-b2 = <strong>A statement of good faith</strong> — that you have a good faith belief that the use of the material in the manner complained of is not authorised by the copyright owner, its agent, or the law.
legal-dmca-3-b3 = <strong>A statement of accuracy</strong> — that the information in the notice is accurate and, under penalty of perjury, that you are authorised to act on behalf of the copyright owner.
legal-dmca-3-b4 = <strong>Send notices to:</strong> { $support_email }
legal-dmca-3-b5 = We will review all notices and remove links from our index that satisfy the above statutory requirements.
legal-dmca-3-b6 = <strong>Counter-Notification:</strong> If you believe your link was removed in error, you may submit a counter-notification under 17 U.S.C. § 512(g).
legal-dmca-4-title = 4. Important Limitation — We Can Only Remove Links
legal-dmca-4-body = Because { $brand } does not host any media files, we are only able to remove the link from our search index. We cannot remove the underlying content from the server on which it is hosted.
legal-dmca-5-title = 5. Repeat Infringer Policy
legal-dmca-5-body = In appropriate circumstances, and at our sole discretion, { $brand } will disable or terminate access for users or accounts that are repeat infringers.
legal-dmca-6-title = 6. No Admission of Liability
legal-dmca-6-body = Removal of a link from our index in response to a DMCA notice does not constitute an admission by { $brand } that any infringement has occurred.
