legal-disclaimer-1-body = { $brand } is a link aggregator and search engine for publicly available embedded media links. We do not host, upload, store, transmit, or control any video, audio, or media content on our servers.
legal-disclaimer-2-title = 2. Third-Party Content — No Liability
legal-disclaimer-2-body = All content accessible via links indexed by { $brand } originates from external, independent third-party sources. { $brand } has no control over, and assumes no responsibility for, the legality, accuracy, quality, or availability of such content.
legal-disclaimer-3-title = 3. User Assumption of Risk
legal-disclaimer-3-body = You acknowledge and agree that your use of { $brand } and your access to any content via external embedded links is entirely at your own risk. { $brand } expressly disclaims all warranties, express or implied.
legal-disclaimer-4-title = 4. Link Availability
legal-disclaimer-4-body = Embedded links indexed by { $brand } point to resources on third-party servers. We cannot guarantee the ongoing availability, quality, or completeness of any linked content, and links may break or become unavailable without notice.
legal-disclaimer-5-title = 5. Accuracy of Information
legal-disclaimer-5-body = Metadata displayed on { $brand } (including titles, descriptions, ratings, and images) is sourced from third-party data providers such as TMDB. We do not guarantee the accuracy or completeness of this metadata.
